==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{settheory}} With respect to another [[set]], a set such that each of the [[element]]s of the other set is also an element of the set.
#: ''The set of [[human being]]s is a superset of the set of [[children]].''
# {{exercise}} Two different [[exercise]]s performed [[back-to-back]], without a period of [[rest]] between them.  The exercises may employ the same muscle group, or opposing muscle groups.
{{wikipedia|subset}}<!--the Wikipedia article "superset" is a redirect to "subset"-->

